  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">4th International Conference on SIDS (2023-2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project involves: (1) convening the 4th International Conference on SIDS in 2024, and (2) convening a preparatory process for the 4th International Conference on SIDS starting in 2023. The objective is to provide the necessary support to the 4th International Conference on SIDS and its preparatory process.
The Danish grant supports stakeholder participation in the fourth International Conference on SIDS in 2024 and in the regional preparatory meetings.</narrative>
  </description>
